1. **trier_tableau** — Bubble sort (O(n²), stable, in-place)
```javascript
function trier_tableau(arr) {
  let n = arr.length;
  for (let i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {
    for (let j = 0; j < n - 1 - i; j++) {
      if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {
        // Swap: bubble up the smaller element
        [arr[j], arr[j + 1]] = [arr[j + 1], arr[j]];
      }
    }
  }
  return arr;
}

console.log(trier_tableau([5, 3, 8, 2])); // [2, 3, 5, 8]
```

